00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,067
This is Video Review. Pause any video, or draw a box on the frame, and write a comment.

2
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:14,333
Your comments queue up. Press command enter, and they go to your agent as one batch, with the time, the frame, and the transcript.

3
00:00:14,333 --> 00:00:21,233
The agent reads your notes and answers right inside the player. No copying, and no screenshots.
